%%WIKI-SYNC-META%%
**Abstract.** Situated Activities record what stakeholders do today, under the conditions they actually do it in. The current concept is the resident's daily walk, where a robot could take the place of a walking dog or an accompanying care worker. The earlier morning-care concept is kept for traceability. It is superseded and no longer drives the design.

